          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi munduukho eyo olwika olukhongo lulakhupwa, ne baleetsa, abali nibatibila mushialo shiaAshuru, nenie abo abali nibaarwa okhumenya mushialo shiaMisiri; ne balamwinamila OMWAMI mushikulu eshitakatifu eYerusalemu.",
